    initial layout with shifting
    key frame interpolation
    2D color function of t
pattern includes supported, recommended animation types

if a pattern has a fixed size, display pixels will be 2D interpolated (bilinear, bicubic)

arrangement: physical layout and dimensions
pattern: initial colors and animation
frame: instantaneous display state

scene has frame, arrangement dimensions
pattern has frame, dimensions may or may not be the same
pattern(t) is mapped to scene frame, or pattern is given scene/bufferframe to fill in


